Robert '''"Sniket"''' Edman was a first-generation [[Quake]] professional, active from release up until [[2000]].
He was the man behind the deal with Café Nine, which resulted in a sponsorship for his clan [[Up Your Backpack]] who then renamed to [[Clan 9]].

In [[2022]] and [[2024]], he organized [[QHLAN2022]] and [[QHLAN2024]] respectively, in his own event studio, Epic Studios, in Stockholm.
